	<key>readme</key>
	<string>kalkal — Multi-calendar date converter

USAGE:
  cal 15 Ramadan 1446     → convert Hijri date
  cal 2024-3-22           → convert Gregorian date
  cal today               → convert today's date
  cal 1446/9/15 hijri     → explicit source calendar

SUPPORTED CALENDARS:
  Hijri, Gregorian, Julian, Coptic, Ethiopian, Solar Hijri,
  Hebrew, Byzantine, Syriac, Rūmī, Armenian, Egyptian,
  Ab Urbe Condita, Olympiad

MODIFIERS:
  ⏎ Enter    → Copy formatted date
  ⌘ Cmd      → Copy Julian Day Number
  ⌥ Alt      → Copy as D/M/Y

UNIVERSAL ACTION:
  Select any text containing a date → Universal Actions → "Convert Date with kalkal"
</string>
